sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant UI as Frontend Route Guard
    participant API as Django API
    participant M as Permission Middleware
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant WS as Channels
    participant R as Redis

    U->>UI: open /#/subscription/list
    UI->>UI: local state checks (role, plan, isExpired, localStorage)
    UI->>API: GET /api/subscription/list
    API->>M: check request.path and method
    alt collaborator session
        M->>M: resolve connected user + collaborator permissions
        M->>M: evaluate permission registry
        alt permission mapped + granted
            M->>DB: query data
            DB-->>API: results
            API-->>UI: JSON response
            UI-->>U: render list
        else denied / unmapped
            M-->>API: PermissionDenied
            API-->>UI: 403/denied payload
            UI-->>U: error / access blocked
        end
    else athlete/private user
        API->>DB: query allowed public/athlete paths
        DB-->>API: results
        API-->>UI: response
    end

    Note over U,UI: WebSocket flows
    U->>UI: open websocket URL /ws/notifications/?token=...
    UI->>WS: JWT from token/cookie
    WS->>R: consume/publish updates (notifications, agent events)
    WS-->>UI: broadcast updates
